※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4530

※ Every parameter has a value at every call: one the call wrote, by place or
※ by name, or the default the definition wrote.  A parameter with neither is a
※ call the function cannot be entered with.

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let n: u8 = plus(.by ← 2u8)
    0u6

fn plus(n: u8, by: u8 ← 1u8) → u8:
    n + by
